1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,177
Notice what happens as the temperature gap grows.

2
00:00:03,177 --> 00:00:05,468
The coefficient falls steeply.

3
00:00:05,468 --> 00:00:10,481
A chiller, keeping drinks just below room temperature, is cheap to run.

4
00:00:10,481 --> 00:00:14,921
A deep freezer, pumping heat across a big gap, costs far more.

